WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.075
Reading the findings is
where the rules become real.

2
00:00:03.075 --> 00:00:05.075
One fictional account passes.

3
00:00:05.075 --> 00:00:07.245
The other fails five different ways,

4
00:00:07.245 --> 00:00:11.513
from the wrong domain to an expiring
Global Administrator assignment.

5
00:00:11.513 --> 00:00:14.417
Three enforced policies
don't exclude the accounts,

6
00:00:14.417 --> 00:00:18.200
and someone who shouldn't be there
is sitting in the exclusion group.

7
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:21.923
Then the offline match finds
all five emergency events,

8
00:00:21.923 --> 00:00:26.212
where the sample found two, and
ignores an ordinary user's sign-in.

9
00:00:26.212 --> 00:00:30.675
Finally you try to feed it a user name
instead of an ID, and it refuses.

10
00:00:30.675 --> 00:00:34.220
Run the whole suite, and three
hundred thirty tests pass.
